  944                   ;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  945                   ; Select disk (used by BDOS)
  946                   ; drive-code in C (0..n-1)
  947                   ; seldsk sets also the parameters for blocking/deblocking and for the phys.
  948                   ; drive parameters. The phys. drive parameters can be request by the new
  949                   ; BIOS function GETPHY.
  950                   
  951 E452  21 0000     SELDSK:	LD HL,0		; und pruefen ob gueltig
  952 E455  79          	LD A,C		; wenn groesser als ndisks
  953 E456  FE 08       	CP NDISKS	; dann nicht ok
